  "final_answer": "<think>\n\n</think>\n\n- **Root Cause:** The `separability_matrix` fails to recursively evaluate separability in nested `CompoundModel` structures, leading to incorrect matrix construction.  \n- **Nested CompoundModel Behavior:** The matrix incorrectly reports all inputs and outputs as non-separable, even when they are independent in nested models.  \n- **Proposed Patch:** The patch recursively evaluates separability across nested models and constructs a block-diagonal matrix for separable components.  \n- **Regression Tests:** Proposed tests validate the corrected behavior for nested models, but are not yet executed.",
